@prefix reac: <https://chatman.ai/ontology/runtime-evidence-authenticity-control#> .
reac:RuntimeEvidenceAuthenticityControlPack a reac:ControlPack ; reac:authority "SELECT|CONSTRUCT|VERIFY" ; reac:consequentialDo "BRCE_ONLY" ; reac:requiresExactSubject true .
reac:AuthenticityMeasurement a reac:EvidenceClass .
reac:AdmissionPolicy a reac:PolicyClass .
reac:ControlDecision a reac:DecisionClass .
reac:ControlReceipt a reac:ReceiptClass .
reac:subjectSha a reac:IdentityProperty .
reac:semanticDigest a reac:IdentityProperty .
reac:generation a reac:IdentityProperty .
reac:authenticityRate a reac:MetricProperty .
reac:falseAuthenticUpper a reac:MetricProperty .
reac:independentRoots a reac:MetricProperty .
reac:ownerState a reac:StandingProperty .
reac:actuationPerformed a reac:AuthorityProperty .
